            "width": 92.73743016759778,
            "height": 86.09271523178808,
            "action": {
              "library": "H5P.AdvancedText 1.1",
              "params": {
                "text": "<p><strong>Personal Attributes</strong><br>\nKnown for his modesty and private nature, Armstrong was often described as a reluctant hero who shied away from the limelight.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Honors and Awards</strong><br>\nArmstrong received numerous awards, including the Presidential Medal of Freedom and the Congressional Space Medal of Honor.</p>\n\n<p><strong>Death and Tributes</strong><br>\nArmstrong passed away on August 25, 2012, and was remembered as a pioneering astronaut who took humanity's first steps on another world. His contributions to space exploration have inspired generations.</p>\n"
              },
              "metadata": {
                "contentType": "Text",
                "license": "U",
                "title": "Unbenannt: Text",
